---
title: "decrease_supply (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Balance(value) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_validate: check self.value >= value
    q_validate --> q_abort: self.value < value
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EOverflow
    q_validate --> q_update: self.value >= value
    q_update --> q_return: self.value = self.value - value
    q_return --> [*]: return value

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: supply can never go negative (self.value >= value)
        INV-002: burned amount equals the balance value consumed
    end note
